" ⠿ 1 Project  2 Dataset  3 Pipeline  4 Training  5 Logs  6 Compare  rust_expert "
"                                                                                "
" ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ "
" │ Everywhere                                                                 │ "
" │ 1-6, Tab, Shift-Tab        switch view                                     │ "
" │ ?                          this help (Esc, ? or q closes it)               │ "
" │ q, Ctrl-C                  quit                                            │ "
" │ R                          reload the data files and runs                  │ "
" │ g                          open the overbrainer repository in a browser    │ "
" │ r, A                       run auto or a stage (asks which); A: auto       │ "
" │ y, n Esc Enter             in a dialog: confirm, cancel (the default, n)   │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │ Logs                                                                       │ "
" │ k j, Up Down, PgUp PgDn    scroll                                          │ "
" │ G, End                     follow the newest lines                         │ "
" │ f                          cycle level: error, warn, info, debug, trace    │ "
" │ s                          toggle overbrainer / selected run's pod         │ "
" │ x                          export the shown lines to .overbrainer/         │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │ e, d, r, A, t, h, C and J are refused while a stage, an edit or a training │ "
" │ start runs in this TUI; the TUI also holds the project lock, so no other   │ "
" │ overbrainer command writes to the project meanwhile.                       │ "
" ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ "
" Esc close                                                               ? help "
